objections:
  - concern: Our vehicles are spread across multiple vendors and older models. Will they integrate?
    response: Quatro integrates with all major telematics providers (Samsara, Verizon, Geotab, etc.) and supports OBD-II, CAN-bus, and GPS protocols. We also work with legacy vehicles through retrofit sensors at low cost.
  - concern: Driver privacy is a concern. What visibility does the system give into driver location and behavior?
    response: Quatro provides role-based access controls. Drivers see performance feedback; dispatch sees fleet-level metrics and urgent alerts. You set the privacy policy and what data is visible to whom.
  - concern: We have custom routing logic and constraints. Will Quatro's optimization work for our unique needs?
    response: Quatro's route optimization engine accepts custom constraints—time windows, vehicle types, max payloads, driver hours regulations. You define the rules; the system optimizes within them.
